                        ],
                        "form": "râleuses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "08499f15-670c-318f-a4cd-024de1f3cc29",
                        "entry_id": "5b192def-bd50-3e93-b545-fef64d4c5955",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est porté à protester de façon hargneuse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "familiar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a6e34dd-4a45-4dd0-ba4a-4110eb957417",
                                "sense_id": "08499f15-670c-318f-a4cd-024de1f3cc29",
                                "text": "Et on s’engueule dans le tramway déjà un bon coup pour se faire la bouche. Les femmes sont plus râleuses encore que les moutards."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3627ece7-29e3-4d7e-a7c7-4a603b751f8d",
                                "sense_id": "08499f15-670c-318f-a4cd-024de1f3cc29",
                                "text": "On ne savait pas se parler entre nous autrement que d’une manière râleuse."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e31a773-1cb8-45ad-9dd4-a3a2a98db47a",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b192def-bd50-3e93-b545-fef64d4c5955",
                        "source_sense_id": "08499f15-670c-318f-a4cd-024de1f3cc29",
                        "target_lang_word": "Nörgler",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nörgler",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3105a9a3-9f7e-3145-9a6f-79af4b58a4bd",
                                        "entry_id": "21382265-5675-3127-b0ae-f8baf3be8fad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die nörgelt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e4cd1bb-531b-4913-9030-b9f08c0804b7",
                                                "sense_id": "3105a9a3-9f7e-3145-9a6f-79af4b58a4bd",
                                                "text": "„Mit Faust hat Goethe ein Sinnbild des deutschen Nörglers geschaffen, das heute noch gültig ist.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2c158e9-9537-40b2-895c-3e502ee66129",
                                                "sense_id": "3105a9a3-9f7e-3145-9a6f-79af4b58a4bd",
                                                "text": "„Die Nörgler bekamen kein Echo ihrer aufgeblasenen Ansprüche, sondern eine Unterweisung in ziviler Unaufgeregtheit.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "13cd58c2-4ac7-4e97-8bb1-93bd4c30d41d",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b192def-bd50-3e93-b545-fef64d4c5955",
                        "source_sense_id": "08499f15-670c-318f-a4cd-024de1f3cc29",
                        "target_lang_word": "grouch",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "grouch",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "378ea67a-41bd-3d15-b198-6d16334909c3",
                                        "entry_id": "1de59ddc-f511-3f15-8d99-788ec0131d4c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A complaint, a grumble, a fit of ill-humor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15bbc36a-e433-427f-98e7-8b68e300f12b",
                                                "sense_id": "378ea67a-41bd-3d15-b198-6d16334909c3",
                                                "text": "But today he had noticed from the moment he had got out of bed that something was amiss with the world. Either he was in the grip of some divine discontent due to the highly developed condition of his soul, or else he had a grouch."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bff1079-fc57-311f-914b-e1f6ee0ec124",
                                        "entry_id": "1de59ddc-f511-3f15-8d99-788ec0131d4c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who is grumpy or irritable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52e2ce0c-7ec8-43bd-96d8-044a8625bc63",
                                                "sense_id": "9bff1079-fc57-311f-914b-e1f6ee0ec124",
                                                "text": "I don't feel like hanging around with that grouch."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "grouch",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92782cda-cdce-3c6e-b73d-6e85f206bd8f",
                                        "entry_id": "6cfa1575-1ff5-36ae-939c-dc75f2f907a4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be grumpy or irritable; to complain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f27c28f-5034-47f4-ba1d-14e5a078ccfd",
                                                "sense_id": "92782cda-cdce-3c6e-b73d-6e85f206bd8f",
                                                "text": "He spent all his time grouching about the problem instead of fixing it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e493fc5e-bb6d-4f0f-b314-8cc9e126e2db",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b192def-bd50-3e93-b545-fef64d4c5955",
                        "source_sense_id": "08499f15-670c-318f-a4cd-024de1f3cc29",
                        "target_lang_word": "mopperig",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mopperig",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5851af1-9f58-3fe5-971b-5d6ec74c02b4",
                                        "entry_id": "103f6150-c65d-3275-a440-d86ce27bbba7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "veel mopperend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c647aa6f-15f7-4fac-ba95-c8b5a351858d",
                                                "sense_id": "c5851af1-9f58-3fe5-971b-5d6ec74c02b4",
                                                "text": "Wees toch niet zo'n mopperige jongen en doe gezellig mee!"
